ve spending time on the  beach Moana is a great princess to have  in mind when you head to the mall  because she's a princess your dress is  more practical than fanciful you can get  pretty close to pulling off a true Moana  outfit try picking up a white skirt like  this button-up skirt from forever 21 you  can pair it with a ruffled orange tank  top like this one from j.crew this  outfit is pretty simple so have some fun  with your accessories  we know that Moana were the hearts of  two feety so you'll be glad to know you  can pick up your very own from a hot  topic they also have some adorable  earrings inspired by the movie Moana if  you're keeping a casual or hitting the  beach feel free to pair this outfit with  a pair of flip-flops or these cute lace  up sandals from forever 21 or if you  want a different take on Moana tried  this fun maxi dress it's a bit less of a  literal interpretation but we're getting  some serious mulana vibes here enhance  their resemblance by spraying some surf  spray from Bumble and Bumble in your  hair Anna she gets less attention than  her sister Elsa but anna is a great  character with impeccable style we love  her casual look from the record Ralph to  trailer and you can emulate these  serious 90s vibes start out with a  casual pair of jeans shorts which is  something you probably already have in  your closet on a pair of this with the  graphic t-shirt with the nod to the  frozen song love is an open door grab  one of your favorite shades of green and  then top with a casual flannel this is  an easy laid-back look that reminds us  of one of our favorite Disney characters  for a less casual outfit start out with  a blue skirt like this one from forever  21 add a black shirt and whatever style  suits you best to incorporate some fun  texture into this outfit grab this  forever 21 wine colored velvet blazer  keep it in style of frozen by adding a  pair of chic black booties  if you're feeling chilly you can also  add a pair of black